2026-11-03T15:17:39.8240870Z   "plugin_admission_lock_scope": "Existing Rust Skills admission and durable image owner preserves live denial and unknown recovery. Strict v3 uninstallObservation fences a foreign reserve/settle ABA across loader, publication and prune; legacy v1/v2 read facts remain. Authoritative SH image faults latch retained recovery; contended reads and constructors remain observation-only, with explicit fresh recovery required. Workflow mutation re-reads canonical current record, publisher and path under the actual lease. Actual publisher cleanup releases its lease before reentrant diagnostics. All retained assertions and OS/process controls remain required. Real accounts/ecosystem, hostile directory replacement, power loss, performance and supported-platform package acceptance remain open.",
